LibreGround
==========

The factory, click parser, and adapters under ``libreyolo/models/ground/``
are original LibreYOLO code. They load Hugging Face snapshots; they do not
vendor upstream model source.

Hosted weight snapshots
-----------------------

Florence-2-base (``LibreYOLO/LibreGroundFlorence2base``)
    Mirrored from ``florence-community/Florence-2-base`` at
    ``00921df66db728a9ceb750f5eca43e5c203a2051``.
    Weight license: MIT (``microsoft/Florence-2-base`` LICENSE).

ShowUI-2B (``LibreYOLO/LibreShowUI2b``)
    Mirrored from ``showlab/ShowUI-2B`` at
    ``cabec4fcc48d15ffd3efe0b33ea9bc7d41509d60``.
    The pinned upstream model card declares ``license: mit`` for the
    weights. The ShowUI training/inference repository
    (https://github.com/showlab/ShowUI) is Apache-2.0. The Qwen2-VL-2B
    base (``Qwen/Qwen2-VL-2B-Instruct``) is Apache-2.0. Those Apache
    obligations apply to the code and the base model; they are not a
    re-license of the ShowUI-2B weight grant.

Qwen3-VL-2B (``LibreYOLO/LibreGroundQwen3VL2b``)
    Mirrored from ``Qwen/Qwen3-VL-2B-Instruct`` at
    ``89644892e4d85e24eaac8bacfd4f463576704203``.
    Weight license: Apache-2.0.

Moondream 2 (``LibreYOLO/LibreMoondream2``)
    Already published for LibreVLM. Apache-2.0. The grounding wrapper
    reuses that snapshot (``FAMILY = ground_moondream``).
